Status pills (Online / Healthy / Live / In review) render as pills with a pulsing dot on in-flight states; group heads use the ring + count treatment (F-12 device groups unchanged). Add Device is the icon-only title-row ＋ (G3 pass, WP-N3 08-11) — the old label carries as `aria-label`, verb unchanged. Deploy-lane rows open the dedicated `deploy-lane` detail surface (`openDeployLane`).

## Sheets — defined once, opened from here

- **Device capability sheet** — `modals/device-detail.surf` (`name=device-detail`), via This Workspace rows (`openDeviceDetail`). Capability rows per what each machine advertises: Browse files (read-only over the server relay — opens `modals/device-files.surf`), Use for Surfy (routing toggle), Run build; every UNAVAILABLE capability row carries the explaining reason in its meta (parity canon: shown with reason, never hidden). Remove device is the danger row.
- **Enroll device** — `modals/enroll-device.surf` (`name=enroll-device`), via Add Device (`openEnrollDevice`): code + QR + device-scoped-key explanation.
- **Add model server** — `modals/add-model-server.surf` (`name=add-model-server`), via the trailing Add row (`openAddModelServer`). Add PROBES the endpoint before confirming; no unverified server is ever saved.
